  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "World 2 difficulty 1 uses the direct public level-27 values; no interpolation is used.",
    "Purge Order deals 400% ATK Physical damage to all opponents, and Destruction Order deals 300% ATK Physical damage to one opponent.",
    "Detonation Order creates an owner-linked Automaton Spider with an executable self-explosion action.",
    "Enrage Order applies a two-turn resistible taunt that forces each affected unit's Basic ATK to target the living Grizzly applier; phase one uses 50% base chance and phase two uses 100%.",
    "Overcombust Order charges the next Purge Order and adds one permanent Obliteration stack; each stack contributes +50% ordinary damage.",
    "Phase two consumes the Direwolf Teamwork Order coordination marker through an immediate Purge candidate before returning to the source-ordered action cycle.",
    "The two phase graphs, damage, summon, taunt, charge chain, stacking damage boost and teammate coordination use shared enemy lifecycle and Rule IR without a native handler."
  ]
